---

Distributions built by packaging/build.py additionally bundle third-party
components under their own licenses:

* A minimal Java runtime produced with jlink from OpenJDK — GPLv2 with the
  Classpath Exception.
* W3C EPUBCheck — BSD 3-Clause. Its own license and third-party notices are
  included in the epubcheck/ folder of the distribution.
* Qt via PySide6 — LGPLv3. Qt libraries are shipped as separate, replaceable
  shared libraries and are not statically linked.
